{"content_hash": "db734884dd7c93e5", "version_id": 715, "article_id": 72, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Kylie Jenner wears $50m bra at Victoria's Secret show, dividing fans", "title_zh": "凯莉·詹娜穿5000万美元胸衣走维密秀，网友吵翻了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmx2wqwxvyxlo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/flagged/photo-1557286249-08f5bc2ef21d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8a3lsaWUlMjBqZW5uZXJ8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjQ1NjMzNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Joel Muniz on Unsplash", "author": "Joel Muniz", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jmuniz?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-pointing-forward-mXF1hOJ37BI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(338, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(16, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "8b222ce941c5"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-20", "word_count": 275, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Reality TV star Kylie Jenner made her Victoria's Secret Fashion Show debut in the famous Fantasy Bra, prompting both cheers and criticism over whether a veteran model should have worn it.", "lead_zh": "真人秀明星凯莉·詹娜首次登上维密秀，身穿著名的“梦幻胸衣”，引发欢呼与批评：有人认为这件胸衣本该由资深超模来穿。", "preview": "Jenner, 29, surprised the audience at the lingerie brand's annual show on Sunday by appearing in the Fantasy Bra, a piece crafted from 18-ca", "preview_zh": "29岁的詹娜周日现身这家内衣品牌的年度大秀，身穿“梦幻胸衣”惊艳全场。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石打造，价值5000万美元（约合3700万英镑）。梦幻胸衣历来是大秀的压轴看点，通常只留给被选中的模特，被视为职业生涯的高光时刻。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 703, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 115.35, "size_bytes": 693072, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 320, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 118.875, "size_bytes": 714240, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 320, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 125.85, "size_bytes": 756000, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 320, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 108.15, "size_bytes": 649872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 320, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 118.85, "size_bytes": 714096, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 320, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5e0dbb9/content/data/versions/715.json", "paragraphs": ["Jenner, 29, surprised the audience at the lingerie brand's annual show on Sunday by appearing in the Fantasy Bra, a piece crafted from 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds and valued at $50m (£37m), according to its designer. Long a centrepiece of the show, the bra is customarily reserved for a chosen model and regarded as a defining career moment.", "Some fans were delighted to see the Kardashians star selected, yet many accused the brand of denying the honour to a veteran supermodel. Beneath a video unveiling the look on Victoria's Secret's Instagram page, critics denounced the choice as \"pure disrespect to real models\" and lamented that the show had descended from \"iconic glamour to an influencer circus\".", "Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson argues the moment was shrewdly engineered, generating widespread debate about the future of modelling. Brands, he contends, now prize whoever draws the most attention over anyone fitting a conventional model template, while acknowledging that devotees of \"the iconic Naomi Campbell era\" may perceive the decision as a betrayal.", "Adam Selman, the brand's chief creative officer, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen as a \"cultural powerhouse\" whose reach extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth, 25, interprets the booking as an attempt to court younger audiences, though she questions the wisdom of spotlighting so extravagant a garment when many struggle to afford basic necessities.", "The show was scrapped after its 2018 edition drew poor ratings and criticism that it was sexist and lacked diversity, returning in 2024 with a pledge to celebrate all women. This year's Fantasy Bra, made with jeweller Jacob & Co, took 15 artists more than 1,000 hours to complete."], "paragraphs_zh": ["29岁的詹娜周日现身这家内衣品牌的年度大秀，身穿“梦幻胸衣”惊艳全场。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石打造，价值5000万美元（约合3700万英镑）。梦幻胸衣历来是大秀的压轴看点，通常只留给被选中的模特，被视为职业生涯的高光时刻。", "部分粉丝为这位卡戴珊家族明星的入选感到欣喜，但许多人指责品牌剥夺了资深超模的机会。在维密Instagram发布造型揭晓视频的评论区，批评者痛斥这一选择是“对真正模特的公然不敬”，并感叹大秀已从“经典魅力沦为网红马戏团”。", "营销专家乔尔·马利纳森认为，这一安排是精心设计的，引发了关于模特行业未来的广泛讨论。他表示，如今品牌更看重谁能吸引最多眼球，而非谁符合传统模特的模板；但他也承认，怀念“娜奥米·坎贝尔经典时代”的观众可能会觉得这是一种背叛。", "品牌首席创意官亚当·塞尔曼告诉《Vogue》，选中詹娜是因为她是“文化巨擘”，影响力早已超越时尚和电视。25岁的英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯认为，此举意在讨好年轻观众，但她质疑，在许多人连基本生活都难以负担时，如此大张旗鼓地展示一件天价内衣是否明智。", "维密秀在2018年因收视低迷、被批性别歧视和缺乏多元而停办，2024年回归并承诺“赞美所有女性”。今年的梦幻胸衣由珠宝品牌Jacob & Co合作打造，15位工匠耗时逾1000小时才完成。"], "body": "Jenner, 29, surprised the audience at the lingerie brand's annual show on Sunday by appearing in the Fantasy Bra, a piece crafted from 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds and valued at $50m (£37m), according to its designer. Long a centrepiece of the show, the bra is customarily reserved for a chosen model and regarded as a defining career moment.\n\nSome fans were delighted to see the Kardashians star selected, yet many accused the brand of denying the honour to a veteran supermodel. Beneath a video unveiling the look on Victoria's Secret's Instagram page, critics denounced the choice as \"pure disrespect to real models\" and lamented that the show had descended from \"iconic glamour to an influencer circus\".\n\nMarketing expert Joel Marlinarson argues the moment was shrewdly engineered, generating widespread debate about the future of modelling. Brands, he contends, now prize whoever draws the most attention over anyone fitting a conventional model template, while acknowledging that devotees of \"the iconic Naomi Campbell era\" may perceive the decision as a betrayal.\n\nAdam Selman, the brand's chief creative officer, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen as a \"cultural powerhouse\" whose reach extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth, 25, interprets the booking as an attempt to court younger audiences, though she questions the wisdom of spotlighting so extravagant a garment when many struggle to afford basic necessities.\n\nThe show was scrapped after its 2018 edition drew poor ratings and criticism that it was sexist and lacked diversity, returning in 2024 with a pledge to celebrate all women. This year's Fantasy Bra, made with jeweller Jacob & Co, took 15 artists more than 1,000 hours to complete.", "body_zh": "29岁的詹娜周日现身这家内衣品牌的年度大秀，身穿“梦幻胸衣”惊艳全场。据设计师介绍，这件胸衣由18K金和4410颗钻石打造，价值5000万美元（约合3700万英镑）。梦幻胸衣历来是大秀的压轴看点，通常只留给被选中的模特，被视为职业生涯的高光时刻。\n\n部分粉丝为这位卡戴珊家族明星的入选感到欣喜，但许多人指责品牌剥夺了资深超模的机会。在维密Instagram发布造型揭晓视频的评论区，批评者痛斥这一选择是“对真正模特的公然不敬”，并感叹大秀已从“经典魅力沦为网红马戏团”。\n\n营销专家乔尔·马利纳森认为，这一安排是精心设计的，引发了关于模特行业未来的广泛讨论。他表示，如今品牌更看重谁能吸引最多眼球，而非谁符合传统模特的模板；但他也承认，怀念“娜奥米·坎贝尔经典时代”的观众可能会觉得这是一种背叛。\n\n品牌首席创意官亚当·塞尔曼告诉《Vogue》，选中詹娜是因为她是“文化巨擘”，影响力早已超越时尚和电视。25岁的英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯认为，此举意在讨好年轻观众，但她质疑，在许多人连基本生活都难以负担时，如此大张旗鼓地展示一件天价内衣是否明智。\n\n维密秀在2018年因收视低迷、被批性别歧视和缺乏多元而停办，2024年回归并承诺“赞美所有女性”。今年的梦幻胸衣由珠宝品牌Jacob & Co合作打造，15位工匠耗时逾1000小时才完成。", "text": "Jenner, 29, surprised the audience at the lingerie brand's annual show on Sunday by appearing in the Fantasy Bra, a piece crafted from 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds and valued at $50m (£37m), according to its designer. Long a centrepiece of the show, the bra is customarily reserved for a chosen model and regarded as a defining career moment. Some fans were delighted to see the Kardashians star selected, yet many accused the brand of denying the honour to a veteran supermodel. Beneath a video unveiling the look on Victoria's Secret's Instagram page, critics denounced the choice as \"pure disrespect to real models\" and lamented that the show had descended from \"iconic glamour to an influencer circus\". Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson argues the moment was shrewdly engineered, generating widespread debate about the future of modelling. Brands, he contends, now prize whoever draws the most attention over anyone fitting a conventional model template, while acknowledging that devotees of \"the iconic Naomi Campbell era\" may perceive the decision as a betrayal. Adam Selman, the brand's chief creative officer, told Vogue that Jenner was chosen as a \"cultural powerhouse\" whose reach extends beyond fashion and television. British model Summer Nesbeth, 25, interprets the booking as an attempt to court younger audiences, though she questions the wisdom of spotlighting so extravagant a garment when many struggle to afford basic necessities. The show was scrapped after its 2018 edition drew poor ratings and criticism that it was sexist and lacked diversity, returning in 2024 with a pledge to celebrate all women. This year's Fantasy Bra, made with jeweller Jacob & Co, took 15 artists more than 1,000 hours to complete.", "vocab": [{"word": "spark", "pos": "verb", "zh": "引发，激起", "note": "常与 reaction/debate 搭配，新闻高频", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "centrepiece", "pos": "noun", "zh": "核心亮点，压轴之物", "note": "指活动或展示中最受瞩目的部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "customarily", "pos": "adv", "zh": "按照惯例地", "note": "正式用语，相当于 usually by tradition", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "denounce", "pos": "verb", "zh": "谴责，公开批评", "note": "语气比 criticise 更强", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lament", "pos": "verb", "zh": "哀叹，惋惜", "note": "书面语，表达遗憾之情", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "descend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "沦落，堕落", "note": "descend from...to... 表示由好转坏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shrewdly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "精明地，巧妙地", "note": "修饰 engineered 等，表示手段高明", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "engineer", "pos": "verb", "zh": "精心策划，设计", "note": "此处指人为制造话题", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "contend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "主张，断言", "note": "正式用语，引出观点", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "template", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模板，标准样式", "note": "cookie-cutter template 指千篇一律的模式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "perceive", "pos": "verb", "zh": "认为，看作", "note": "perceive sth as... 常见搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "powerhouse", "pos": "noun", "zh": "巨头，实力派人物", "note": "cultural powerhouse 指文化影响力巨大的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "court", "pos": "verb", "zh": "讨好，争取", "note": "court younger audiences 争取年轻受众", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "extravagant", "pos": "adj", "zh": "奢侈的，铺张的", "note": "形容价格高昂、过于华丽之物", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-20T00:32:12.999882", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Jenner", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.725, "sm": 325, "em": 724, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": ",", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.8, "sm": 725, "em": 799, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "29", "s": 0.8, "e": 1.625, "sm": 800, "em": 1625, "cs": 8, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.625, "e": 1.725, "sm": 1625, "em": 1725, "cs": 10, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "surprised", "s": 1.725, "e": 2.237, "sm": 1725, "em":